{"unit_id":"tag:06QL:title","translation":"性质下降（descending）的变体","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"descending","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"descending","target_term":"下降","context":"本节讨论性质下降的其他形式。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06QL:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n有时也可以对非局部（local）性质作下降（descend）。本节收集这类结果。关于态射（morphisms）的性质（例如光滑性（smoothness））的下降（descending），也可参见第<REF_0001>节。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部"},{"source_term":"descend","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"smoothness","target_term":"光滑性"},{"source_term":"descending","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"local","target_term":"局部","context":"这里讨论不一定具有覆盖局部性的性质。"},{"source_term":"descend","target_term":"下降","context":"从覆盖上推回概形性质。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所引用节讨论的对象。"},{"source_term":"smoothness","target_term":"光滑性","context":"所引用节中的典型态射性质。"},{"source_term":"descending","target_term":"下降","context":"所引用节讨论的性质下降。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06QM:statement","translation":"若<MATH_0001>是概形（schemes）之间的平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphism），且<MATH_0002>约化（reduced），则<MATH_0003>约化（reduced）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"给定态射的源和目标。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"用于下降约化性的态射条件。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"用于下降约化性的覆盖条件。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"源概形到目标概形的态射。"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化","context":"从源概形下降到目标概形的性质。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06QM:proof","translation":"考察局部环（local rings）（《概形（Schemes）》定义<REF_0001>），并利用《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>，即可得到结果。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环","context":"用于逐点检验约化性的环。"},{"source_term":"Schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"所引用章节的标题。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所引用章节的标题。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06QN:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0002>局部有限表现（locally of finite presentation）、平坦（flat）且为满射（surjective），而<MATH_0003>正则（regular），则<MATH_0004>正则（regular）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表现"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"原文指定的源和目标对象。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定的代数空间态射。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限表现","context":"下降正则性所需的有限性条件。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"下降正则性所需的平坦性条件。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"下降正则性所需的覆盖条件。"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则","context":"从源对象下降到目标对象的正则性。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06QN:proof","translation":"该引理化归为如下代数（algebra）陈述：若<MATH_0001>是忠实平坦（faithfully flat）、有限表现（finitely presented）的环（ring）同态（homomorphism），且<MATH_0002>诺特（Noetherian）且正则（regular），则<MATH_0003>诺特（Noetherian）且正则（regular）。由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0001>可知，<MATH_0004>诺特（Noetherian）；由《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>可知，它正则（regular）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"化归后的环论陈述。"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"用于下降的环同态。"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表现","context":"环同态的有限性条件。"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环","context":"同态的源和目标。"},{"source_term":"homomorphism","target_term":"同态","context":"给定的环同态。"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"环的诺特性。"},{"source_term":"regular","target_term":"正则","context":"由平坦局部下降得到的正则性。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所引用章节的标题。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04QQ:title","translation":"概形（schemes）的芽（Germs）","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Germs","target_term":"芽"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"芽所属的几何对象。"},{"source_term":"Germs","target_term":"芽","context":"概形与其点组成的芽，译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04QR:statement","translation":"概形（schemes）的芽（Germs）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>对（pair）<MATH_0001>由一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0002>和一个点（point）<MATH_0003>组成，称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004>在（at）<MATH_0005>处的芽（germ）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0003><TEXTITOPEN_0002>芽态射（morphism of germs）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002><MATH_0006>是概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0007>的一个等价类（equivalence class），满足<MATH_0008>，其中<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>的一个开邻域（open neighbourhood）。这样的两个<MATH_0011>、<MATH_0012>称为等价（equivalent）的，当且仅当<MATH_0013>和<MATH_0014>在<MATH_0015>的某个开邻域（open neighbourhood）中相同。\n<STRUCT_0004>我们通过复合（composing）各代表（representatives）来定义<TEXTITOPEN_0003>芽态射的复合（composition of morphisms of germs）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>（这是良定义（well defined）的）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Germs","target_term":"芽"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"对"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"at","target_term":"在"},{"source_term":"germ","target_term":"芽"},{"source_term":"morphism of germs","target_term":"芽态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalence class","target_term":"等价类"},{"source_term":"open neighbourhood","target_term":"开邻域"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"open neighbourhood","target_term":"开邻域"},{"source_term":"composing","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"representatives","target_term":"代表"},{"source_term":"composition of morphisms of germs","target_term":"芽态射的复合"},{"source_term":"well defined","target_term":"良定义"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"芽所属的对象及代表态射的源和目标。"},{"source_term":"Germs","target_term":"芽","context":"本定义的主题，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"pair","target_term":"对","context":"概形与其点组成的有序对。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"构成芽的概形。"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点","context":"构成芽的所选点。"},{"source_term":"at","target_term":"在","context":"强调参数中指定芽所在点的介词用法。"},{"source_term":"germ","target_term":"芽","context":"概形在指定点处的芽。"},{"source_term":"morphism of germs","target_term":"芽态射","context":"局部代表态射的等价类。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"作为芽态射代表的概形态射。"},{"source_term":"equivalence class","target_term":"等价类","context":"在点的较小邻域上相同的代表组成的类。"},{"source_term":"open neighbourhood","target_term":"开邻域","context":"芽态射代表的定义域及判定等价的邻域。"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两个代表在足够小邻域中相同。"},{"source_term":"composing","target_term":"复合","context":"用代表的复合定义芽态射的复合。"},{"source_term":"representatives","target_term":"代表","context":"芽态射的局部概形态射代表。"},{"source_term":"composition of morphisms of germs","target_term":"芽态射的复合","context":"由代表的复合定义的运算。"},{"source_term":"well defined","target_term":"良定义","context":"复合不依赖代表的选取。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04QQ:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n继续之前，还需要一个定义。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[],"unknown_terms":[],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:04QS:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是芽（germs）的态射（morphism）。若存在一个代表（representative）<MATH_0003>，它对应于<MATH_0004>，并且是概形（schemes）的平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）（分别为<SPACE_0002>光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）），则称<MATH_0002>为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>的（分别为<SPACE_0001><TEXTITOPEN_0002>光滑（smooth）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>的）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"germs","target_term":"芽"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"representative","target_term":"代表"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"germs","target_term":"芽","context":"给定态射的源和目标芽。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"芽态射及其代表概形态射。"},{"source_term":"representative","target_term":"代表","context":"在开邻域上定义的概形态射。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"代表态射的源和目标对象。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"由平展代表定义的芽态射性质。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"分别由光滑代表定义的芽态射性质。"}],"notes":[]}
